# Reference: HyperLogLog per match, merged for the "all live matches" number.
PFCOUNT visitors:match:m-042
SCARD ch1:seen:m-042
MEMORY USAGE visitors:match:m-042
MEMORY USAGE ch1:seen:m-042
PFADD visitors:match:m-041 u-000001 u-000002 u-000003 u-000010 u-000100
PFMERGE visitors:match:all-live visitors:match:m-041 visitors:match:m-042
PFCOUNT visitors:match:all-live
